            "neg": 0.33,
            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>We use the dictionary</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"101\" src=\"https://gateoverflow.in/?qa=blob&amp;qa_blobid=4203397718145101474\" width=\"276\"/></p><p>Which of the following formulas of predicate logic is the best formalization of the following English sentence:</p><p>If a person does not wear a face mask, he or she is not traveling by public transport.</p></div></span>",
