            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Which of the following is the negation of the statement, \"For all odd primes $p&lt;q$ there exists positive non-primes $r&lt;s$ such that $p^2+q^2=r^2+s^2$.\"</p><p> </p></div></span>",
