            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Consider the following assertion: \"The two statements<br/>(1) $\\exists x \\in D,(P(x) \\wedge Q(x))$ and<br/>(2) $(\\exists x \\in D, P(x)) \\wedge(\\exists x \\in D, Q(x))$ have the same truth value.\" Which of the following is correct?</p></div></span>",
            "image": "",
