                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">This assertion is false. A counterexample is $D=\\mathbb{N}, P(x)=$ \" x is divisible by 6 ,\" $Q(x)=$ \" x is divisible by 3\"</span>",
                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">This assertion is true. The proof follows from the distributive law for $\\wedge$.</span>",
                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">This assertion is false. A counterexample is $D=\\mathbb{Z}, P(x)=$ \" $x<0$,\" $Q(x)=$ \" $x \\geq 0$.\"</span>",
