            "solution": "<div class=\"solution-content\"><a name=\"526225\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>q(x,y) : \"x + 2 &lt; y \" Given expression </p><p>now put what to evalute </p><p>q(1,pi) = 1 + 2 &lt; pi </p><p> 3 &lt; 3.14 (approx) true </p><p><strong>so Ans is : 1 </strong></p></div><br><br><small>Source: <a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/526194/go-classes-dpp-gate-cs-discrete-mathematics-first-order-logic\" target=\"_blank\">GATE Overflow #526194</a></small></div>"
