            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\">Over the universe $\\mathbb{N}$ (natural numbers), is the following statement TRUE or FALSE? (put $0$ for FALSE &amp; $1$ for TRUE)<br/> <br/> $$<br/> \\exists x((x-3=1) \\wedge(x&gt;3))<br/> $$</div></span>",
