            "solution": "<div class=\"solution-content\"><a name=\"525840\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Correct Ans is Option A </p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gateoverflow.in/?qa=blob&amp;qa_blobid=7290153892452090523\"/>Last Step is 1.(p'+ q') </p></div><br><br><small>Source: <a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/525831/go-classes-dpp-gate-cs-discrete-mathematics-propositional-logic\" target=\"_blank\">GATE Overflow #525831</a></small></div>"
