            "solution": "<div class=\"solution-content\"><a name=\"525360\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>(S ∧ A) → P </p><p>= If i study for this exam and attend class, then I will pass the class</p><p>wkt (S ∧ A) → P ≡ ¬(S ∧ A) ∨ P ≡ ¬S ∨ ¬A ∨ P</p><p>(S ∧ A) → P ≡ ¬P → ¬(S ∧ A) ≡ ¬P → (¬S ∨ ¬A)</p><p>= If i do not pass the class, then I did not study for this exam or did not attend class.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Answer: C,D</strong></p></div><br><br><small>Source: <a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/525347/go-classes-dpp-gate-cs-discrete-mathematics-propositional-logic\" target=\"_blank\">GATE Overflow #525347</a></small></div>"
