            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Which of the following is the correct negation of the statement \"For all positive integers n, $\\mathrm{n}+2&gt;8^{\\prime \\prime}$ ?</p></div></span>",
            "image": "",
