            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Julie and Jamie are identical twins - one always lies and one always tells the truth. You meet one of them but do not know which twin lies. You ask the 3-word question \"Does Julie lie?\" and receive the answer \"Yes.\" Which of the following conclusions is correct?</p></div></span>",
