            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\">Given $P=T, Q=T, R=F, S=F$, find the truth value of:<br/> <br/> $$<br/> (\\mathrm{P} \\vee(\\mathrm{Q} \\rightarrow(\\mathrm{R} \\wedge \\neg \\mathrm{P}))) \\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{Q} \\vee \\neg \\mathrm{~S})<br/> $$<br/> <br/> Enter 1 for TRUE and 0 for FALSE.</div></span>",
