            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Given $P=T, Q=T, R=F, S=F$, what is the truth value of $(P \\leftrightarrow R) \\wedge(\\neg Q \\rightarrow S)$ ?</p></div></span>",
