            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Let $w, g$ and $n$ be propositions where $w$ is \"I walk to work\", $g$ is \"I work in Gurugram\", and $n$ is \"I work at night\". The sentence \"When I work at night and I work in Gurugram, I don't walk to work\" could be equivalently written using propositions and logical connectives as:</p></div></span>",
