            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><ul><li>p = \"All the world is apple pie\"</li><li>q = \"All the seas are ink\"</li><li>r = \"All the trees are bread and cheese\"</li><li>s = \"There is nothing to drink\"</li><li>t = \"Socrates was a man\"</li><li>u = \"All men are mortal\"</li><li>v = \"Socrates was mortal\"</li></ul><div><p>What is the correct English translation of ¬s → ¬v ?</p></div></div></span>",
