            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Consider the following two relations $R_1$ and $R_2$ defined on the set of real numbers $\\mathbb{R}$:</p><p>$$R_1=\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid a^2+b^2\\in\\mathbb{Q}\\}$$ $$R_2=\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid a^2+b^2\\notin\\mathbb{Q}\\}$$ where $\\mathbb{Q}$ denotes the set of rational numbers.</p><p><strong>Which of the following statements is correct?</strong></p></div></span>",
