            "neg": 0.33,
            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Let $T=(V, E)$ be a tree, where $V$ is the vertex set and $E$ is the edge set. If $|E|=32$, then $|V|$ is</p></div></span>",
