            "marks": 1,
            "neg": 0.33,
            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"221\" data-start=\"41\">In year $N$, the $300th$ day of the year is a Tuesday. In year $N+1$, the $200th$ day is also a Tuesday. On what day of the week did the $100th$ day of the year $N-1$ occur?</p></div></span>",
